      <p
        class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-zinc-600"
      >
        <span>Gemelo digital · demo estática</span>
        <span>CSS/SVG · 0 KB JS</span>
